Uploading a video

The `Uploader` sends a file to `Storage`, with the label `upload`. `Storage`
tells the `Transcoder`, with the label `new file`. The `Transcoder` writes
three renditions back to `Storage`, with the label `renditions`. The `Player`
streams from the `CDN` with the label `stream`, and the `CDN` pulls from
`Storage` with the label `pull`.
---
Uploader -> Storage: upload
Storage -> Transcoder: new file
Transcoder -> Storage: renditions
Player -> CDN: stream
CDN -> Storage: pull
